## ⚠️ Known Limitations (not bugs, but flag before scope expands)
 
- **[Data safety]** No undo/redo — a misplaced tile cannot be reverted; this is a data-loss risk, not just a UX gap
- **[Concurrency]** SQLite + (likely) Flask dev server — behavior under 2+ concurrent users editing the same world is untested
- **[Traceability]** Codebase location unverified (see Stats footnote) — recommend pushing to a dedicated repo before Sprint 2 so future reports can cite real git data
