## 📋 Recommended Next Sprint Tasks
 
### 🔴 HIGH PRIORITY
 
1. **[BE] AI response fallback** — On malformed JSON from Groq: retry once with a stricter prompt; if still invalid, fall back to empty layout + error toast to user. *(Est: 2h)*
2. **[FE] Collision check + undo/redo stack** — Prevent tile overlap on placement; add at least single-step undo. *(Est: 3-4h)*
### 🟡 MEDIUM PRIORITY
 
